1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,900
Then the school. Chained gates. And
across the road, a thick yellow line
of paint.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:11,133
Read the sign. Out means fourteen days
after the last fever. Not the first.
The last.

3
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:15,900
Rule one. Never cross a quarantine
line unless you can stay on the other
side.

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:21,767
Cross now, and you can't come back.
Stay here, and he may die behind that
fence. Would you cross?

5
00:00:22,267 --> 00:00:25,600
Fourteen days. I'll be right here.
Don't you dare make it fifteen.

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,867
For the record, I hate this line.
